# Milestone 0.1 plan:

  - Support facts, not inferences yet:

    ```js
    import { DB } from '../my/module.js'

    irl.assert(
      DB.person('Serhii').isParentOf('Polina')
    )

    irl.assert([
      DB.person('Nadya').isParentOf('Katya'),
      DB.person('Yura').isParentOf('Katya')
    ])
    ```

  - Support this playground type: Node.js console application doing some primitive
    projection updating.

    - Watch query:  ?+ whom loves jack | person: "jack" loves: _
    - Forget query: ?- whom loves jack
    - Assert fact:  + person: "jack" loves: "tamara"
    - Retract fact: - person: "jack" loves: "tamara"
